            <p>While Dr. Marvin Cohen pioneered the science behind SmartMouth, his son-in-law, Andrew “Andy” Burch, shared his belief that this groundbreaking innovation had the power to change lives.</p>
            <p>Working side by side, Andy and Dr. Cohen grew SmartMouth from a direct-to-dental product into a nationally recognized oral care brand, united by a shared mission to make effective, science-backed oral care solutions accessible to everyone.</p>
            <p>Andy led with kindness, valued his employees, and cared deeply about the people around him. Although he passed away in December 2020, his spirit remains a part of SmartMouth, in the company he helped grow and the family who proudly carries his vision forward.</p>
