          <details>
            <summary>Who founded SmartMouth?<span class="smf-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="smf-faq__a">
              <p>SmartMouth was founded by Dr. Marvin Cohen, a St. Louis dentist and bad-breath researcher who practiced for nearly 50 years. His son-in-law, Andy Burch, helped grow it into a national brand, and today Andy’s daughters, Anna and Haley, carry it forward.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>When did Dr. Cohen start SmartMouth, and what is the zinc ion system?<span class="smf-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="smf-faq__a">
              <p>Dr. Cohen set out to go after the cause of bad breath in 1993. The result was SmartMouth’s patented zinc ion system: two solutions that stay apart in the bottle until you pour. Once combined, the zinc ions bind the sulfur compounds that cause bad breath.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How long does SmartMouth give fresh breath?<span class="smf-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
            <div class="smf-faq__a">
              <p>Fresh breath for 24 hours when you rinse twice a day.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
